WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.340 --> 00:00:03.640
Have you ever thought about standing in the local
body elections?

00:00:04.340 --> 00:00:09.440
It’s a great way to serve your community
and have a say on the future of this district.

00:00:09.820 --> 00:00:16.560
We need new candidates for our Community Boards,
Council and Mayor and almost anyone can stand.

00:00:17.260 --> 00:00:21.280
You don’t need any special qualifications, but like any job

00:00:21.280 --> 00:00:26.400
there are certain qualities that can help make you a successful candidate.

00:00:27.160 --> 00:00:30.700
These include, being well known or connected within your community

00:00:30.700 --> 00:00:33.820
having good leadership or decision-making skills

00:00:33.820 --> 00:00:37.340
and knowing the issues that are important locally.

00:00:37.680 --> 00:00:41.379
So make a difference, nominations are open now.

00:00:41.380 --> 00:00:49.440
Grab the form or find out more at waimakariri.govt.nz/vote2019

